{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n60歲的歐瑞偉（KC）在TVB新劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》中飾演「百變保安」朱基（K.C.），角色充滿神秘感！他表面上是個斜槓族，實際卻是樊亦敏飾演的富豪龔喜的貼身保鏢，更身懷絕技。然而，這位忠心耿耿的保鏢背後，原來藏著一個關於家庭的愧疚秘密，角色層次相當豐富。\n</p>\n<h2>解構朱基雙重身份 表面斜槓族實為貼身保鏢</h2>\n<p>歐瑞偉飾演的朱基（K.C.）年約60歲，綽號「百變保安」。他的身份極具迷惑性，表面上，他是一個擁有多重職業的「斜槓族」，但這一切只是掩飾，他的真正身份是龔喜（樊亦敏飾）的貼身保鏢。這個雙重身份的設定，預告了K.C.將會在劇中展現出靈活多變、神出鬼沒的一面，為劇情增添不少趣味和緊張感。</p>\n<h2>KC忠誠護主身手了得 為搜集情報神出鬼沒</h2>\n<p>在性格方面，K.C.忠誠、恩怨分明，而且身手了得。為了有效地搜集情報以保護雇主龔喜，他經常需要化身成不同身份，例如油漆工、茶記伙計等，在各個場景中神出鬼沒，行事方式相當過癮。這種集忠誠、智慧與武力於一身的角色，完美發揮了歐瑞偉的硬漢形象，同時亦加入了喜劇元素。</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉對龔喜絕對服從 遇衰人即伺機報復</h2>\n<p>作為一名專業保鏢，K.C.對雇主龔喜展現出絕對的服從，並且時刻與她保持著適當的邊界感，公私分明。不過，他並非一個只會聽命的木頭人。當他遇到任何對龔喜不懷好意的人時，他絕不會坐視不理，反而會暗中觀察，並伺機報復，以其人之道還治其人之身，展現出護主心切又腹黑的一面。</p>\n<h2>KC長年離家藏愧疚 揭背後心酸家庭故事線</h2>\n<p>在強悍的外表下，K.C.的內心其實藏著一份柔軟與愧疚。據悉，角色背後有一條感人的家庭故事線。他為了事業長年離家，因此自覺愧對自己的髮妻以及女兒「圓」，心中一直存有遺憾，並經常想盡辦法去補償家人。這條故事線為角色增添了深度，預示著除了動作和搞笑場面外，還將有觸動人心的內心戲。</p>\n<h2>劇迷期待KC發揮：「又有型又打得仲有內心戲！」</h2>\n<p>對於歐瑞偉這個充滿層次的新角色，劇迷們都表示非常期待。網民紛紛留言表示看好他的演出：「KC個角色好有深度喎，唔只係搞笑！」、「歐瑞偉做呢啲角色最正，忠心又有啲神秘感。」、「家庭故事線！睇嚟會有感人場面。」、「又有型又打得，仲有內心戲，必追！」、「期待睇佢點樣變裝，一定好過癮！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_16280825236adaf4cedea5c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_16280825236adaf4cedea5c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_11234112466adaf4d1de31c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_11234112466adaf4d1de31c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_6271892756adaf4d668eee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_6271892756adaf4d668eee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_12133061616adaf4d96db00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_12133061616adaf4d96db00.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_17133229046adaf4dbc069a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_17133229046adaf4dbc069a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_8461266866adaf4de1fd25.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_8461266866adaf4de1fd25.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_15745699206adaf4e03ed98.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_15745699206adaf4e03ed98.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_17138279906adaf4e23fc0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_17138279906adaf4e23fc0d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_11088659656adaf4e43c20c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_11088659656adaf4e43c20c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_17191270396adaf471f38b9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_17191270396adaf471f38b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_14387039866adaf48e1515c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_14387039866adaf48e1515c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_12911590916adaf498e3c1b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_12911590916adaf498e3c1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_7578301976adaf4a5d6082.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_7578301976adaf4a5d6082.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17338755566adaf4b40bc69.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17338755566adaf4b40bc69.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_3477594916adaf4bebae9d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_3477594916adaf4bebae9d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:43.041775+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1301,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:35.711375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:35.711375+00:00","content_hash":"c6ca2123d650272d6ea2e146553ed7f4306b12f7965172dd6c1a77761f1495af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}